fstdumper patch files: attribution and license notice

Upstream project: fstdumper, https://github.com/semify-eda/fstdumper
Upstream revision: 3c7506333d2c9ad098d4526209621ea401a077ba

Patches in this repository (third_party/fstdumper/):

1. fstdumper-xcelium-fixes.patch
   Fixes Xcelium VPI compatibility and final-time value changes. Key
   changes: skip no-op transitions, handle vpiNamedEvent without calling
   vpi_get_value (Xcelium aborts otherwise), fix a one byte buffer
   overrun when dumping X values, traverse vpiInterface scopes, guard
   unsupported VPI iterators on Xcelium, flush pending value changes
   before $finish, add a regression testbench.

2. fstdumper-perf-opt.patch (optional)
   Caches vpiType and vpiSize at registration time and reuses a
   per-signal buffer in the hot path, removing per value change
   vpi_get calls and malloc/free.

